# Neon Serverless Postgres Configuration
# When you're ready to connect your live Neon database:
# 1. Create a project at https://console.neon.tech
# 2. Run the migration script in `neon/migrations/001_init_nuts_schema.sql` in the Neon SQL Editor
# 3. Paste your Postgres connection string below (Pooled or Direct)
VITE_NEON_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@ep-sample-pooler-123456.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require
